{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-148-1","title":"Psalms 148:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The psalmist exhorts the celestial, 7 the terrestrial, 11 and the rational creatures to praise God.</p>\n<p>Praise ye the Lord. Heb. Hallelujah. 89:5; 146:1; Isa 49:13; Lu 2:13,14; Re 19:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-2","title":"Psalms 148:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>all his angels. 103:20,21; Job 38:7; Isa 6:2-4; Eze 3:12; Re 5:11-13 all his hosts. Ge 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-3","title":"Psalms 148:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>sun. 8:1-3; 19:1-6; 89:36,37; 136:7-9; Ge 1:14-16; 8:22; De 4:19 Jer 33:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-4","title":"Psalms 148:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>heavens. 113:6; 1Ki 8:27; 2Co 12:2 waters. 104:3; Ge 1:7; 7:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-5","title":"Psalms 148:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>for he. 33:6-9; 95:5; Ge 1:1,2,6; Jer 10:11-13; Am 9:6; Re 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-6","title":"Psalms 148:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>He hath also. 89:37; 93:1; 119:90,91; Job 38:10,11,33; Pr 8:27-29; Isa 54:9 Jer 31:35,36; 33:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-7","title":"Psalms 148:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>from the earth. 1 ye dragons. 74:13,14; 104:25,26; Ge 1:21; Job 41:1-34; Isa 27:1; 43:20; 51:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-8","title":"Psalms 148:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Fire. 147:15-18; Ge 19:24; Ex 9:23-25; Le 10:2; Nu 16:35; Jos 10:11 Job 37:2-6; 38:22-37; Isa 66:16; Joe 2:30; Am 7:4; Re 16:8,9,21 stormy. 107:25-29; Ex 10:13,19; 14:21; Am 4:13; Jon 1:4; Mt 8:24-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-9","title":"Psalms 148:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Mountains. 65:12,13; 96:11-13; 97:4,5; 98:7-9; 114:3-7; Isa 42:11; 44:23 Isa 49:13; 55:12,13; 64:1; Eze 36:1-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-10","title":"Psalms 148:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Beasts. 50:10,11; 103:22; 150:6; Ge 1:20-25 flying fowl. Heb. birds of wing. Ge 7:14; *marg: Eze 17:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-11","title":"Psalms 148:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Kings. 2:10-12; 22:27-29; 66:1-4; 68:31,32; 72:10,11; 86:9; 102:15; 138:4,5 Pr 8:15,16; Isa 49:23; 60:3; Re 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-12","title":"Psalms 148:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>young men. 8:2; 68:25; Jer 31:13; Zec 9:17; Mt 21:15,16; Lu 19:37; Tit 2:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-13","title":"Psalms 148:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>for his name. 8:1,9; 99:3,4,9; So 5:9,16; Isa 6:3; Zec 9:17; Php 3:8 excellent. Heb. exalted. 1Ch 29:11; Isa 12:4; 33:5; Mt 6:13 glory. 57:6; 72:19; 108:4; 113:4; Eph 4:10; 1Pe 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-148-14","title":"Psalms 148:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":148,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":148,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>exalteth. 75:10; 89:17; 92:10; 112:9; 1Sa 2:1; Lu 1:52 the praise. 145:10; 149:9; Lu 2:32; Re 5:8-14 a people. Ex 19:5,6; De 4:7; Eph 2:13,17,19; 1Pe 2:9</p>"}]}